  "Líneas (edges) a lo largo de la pista entre sus dos bordes. 0 = solo los bordes (la sección es una recta, así la forma es la misma con menos triángulos)": "Lines (edges) along the track between its two edges. 0 = only the edges (the cross-section is a straight line, so the shape is the same with fewer triangles)",
